  "description": "AnglrMSBuildTasks provides MSBuild tasks for parsing Anglr source files and generating\n      structured outputs such as parse trees, syntax trees, and intermediate representations.\n      These tasks integrate directly into the build pipeline, enabling automatic parsing,\n      tree construction, code generation, and artifact emission. Supports per-file metadata,\n      incremental builds, and seamless integration with the Anglr toolchain.",
